<title>EGYPT: Suez Canal Bank results end-Q1 97.</title>
<headline>Suez Canal Bank results end-Q1 97.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results released at the end of the first three months of calendar 1997, the bank's financial year.</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds, no comparative figures available):</p>
<p> Total assets		  5,769,059,000</p>
<p> Total deposits		4,446,782,000</p>
<p> Reserves			  161,424,000</p>
<p> Shareholders funds	    215,768,000</p>
<p> Distributable profits	  13,130,000</p>
<p>(Full name is Suez Canal Bank )</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
